Usage: cs [options] [command] [command options]
  Options:
    --access-token-file
      File used instead of reading the access tokens
	  from "~/.cs/access-tokens.json".
    --config-file
      Configuration file used instead of reading the default configuration
	  from "~/.cs/config".
    --debug
      Set log level to debug.
    --help
      Displays this help message.
  Commands:
    configure      Set the Carbyne Stack CLI default configuration
      Usage: configure [options]
        Options:
          --help
            Show help message on how to use and adapt the configuration.
          show
            Prints the CLI configuration that is currently in use.
            Default: false

    login      Login to the configured VCPs
      Usage: login [options]
        Options:
          --help
            Show help message on how to use the login command.

    amphora      Create and retrieve secrets from Amphora service(s)
      Usage: amphora <args>

    castor      Upload to and download from Castor Service
      Usage: castor <args>

    ephemeral      Execute functions using Ephemeral
      Usage: ephemeral <args>

    thymus      Interact with the Thymus IAM subsystem
      Usage: thymus <args>


